{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/337334-recruitment-quick-werewolf-the-apocalypse-game","id":337334,"title":"[Recruitment] Quick Werewolf: the Apocalypse Game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-11T12:41:13-08:00","id":337334,"title":"[Recruitment] Quick Werewolf: the Apocalypse Game","content":"Alright, so I'm looking to try my hand at being a storyteller. Specifically, I'd like to run Werewolf: the Apocalypse, taking a character from their First Change to their Rite of Passage. It'll be a solo game, short, heavily character driven, with the setting determined by your character's backstory. Just keep in mind that we're playing in the modern day.<br /> <br /> We will be playing through skype (text, no voice or video required) or play by post. My posting habits range from multiple times a day to a few times per week. Dice rolling will be done through <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/\" target=\"_blank\">Invisible Castle.</a><br /> <br /> Character creation will be by the book (20th Anniversary), a Rank 1 Cliath (even though we'll be playing through the First Change). We'll be using the Nature/Demeanor system, along with Merits &amp; Flaws.<br /> <br /> All 13 Tribes are available. I <i>may </i>consider running a hengeyokai/ahadi chronicle, but it'll take longer for me to set up, as not only do I have to get familiar with their systems, but the nations/cultures/etc. associated with them, as well.<br /> <br /> All auspices are available, of course, and every breed is, too. However, remember that your character's breed will affect how they're treated - this is especially true for Metis. And speaking of Metis, they will be referred to as 'Anathe' or 'Anathem' (i.e. anathema) in this game, to avoid that awkward association between the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C3%A9tis_people_%28Canada%29\" target=\"_blank\">M\u00e9tis</a> people still living today.<br /> <br /> Now, on to applying! Please fill out the following if interested.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Interests</b><br /> What sort of game are you looking for? Something combat heavy? Mystery, politics? This doesn't need to be long, just a sentence or two.<br /> <br /> <b>Limits</b><br /> Any subject matter you definitely don't want to deal with. For me, that'd be rape - it might be hinted at, but nothing more. And baby eating/violence. Yes, that means no baby eating for you, Red Talons. Baby consumption is something I'm not too particularly thrilled to write about.<br /> <br /> That said, this <i>is</i> the World of Darkness, so if fighting, blood, spirits, and giant monster wolves disturb you, this is probably not the game for you.<br /> <br /> I should also point out here, that out of character, I have little tolerance for racism, transphobia, and other 'isms/phobias, so if you're the type to crack jokes at the expense of marginalized people, this is also not the game for you. Characters, of course, are free to (and many will) be bigots.<br /> <br /> <b>Character Concept</b><br /> The good stuff! Describe your character, their history, their ideals, needs and desires. I don't need a novel, but give me enough to know what they stand for. The character sheet will be filled in after we've worked out your character.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> If there's a lot of interest, I might be able to take on 2-3 people, but I'd like to keep the group small.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":3804,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","user":"Stir of Echoes","date":". 12-12-2014, 07:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-11T13:29:56-08:00","id":337371,"title":"","content":"I am probably interested, but I will need time to get together a proper entry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4462-nohwear","name":"Nohwear","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T04:57:23-08:00","id":337952,"title":"","content":"Take what time you need. :-D I'm looking forward to see what you come up with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T04:27:38-08:00","id":338928,"title":"","content":"I have been giving it some thought, and what makes the most sense for a solo game is a Silent Strider who acts as a messenger and courier between the various packs. As for how to play this, pbp is best for me. I will start working on an actual character,or at least a personality and what not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4462-nohwear","name":"Nohwear","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T21:00:53-08:00","id":339716,"title":"","content":"A great choice, but if you did have interest in other Tribes, don't feel pressured to play a Silent Strider just because this is a solo game. I can create NPC packmates &amp; find other workarounds in those cases.<br /> <br /> Since you chose pbp, we can play here, or another forum of your choice. Myth-Weavers seems like a good option.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],